    "In this candidate the two mounting studs, their nuts and cotters advance by tab stock. Source stock lengths are retained; embedding and new nut stack require checks.",
    "HB79 photo does not show the installed low/track bands or stop mechanism; HB73/123 are shaft sections and do not establish support transverse shape.",
    "SNL252:026 lists four SH687A brake-adjusting spring spacers. These are not in the accepted front checkpoint and remain a separate inventory/geometry gap."
